OL,3,GNEWSAThe man who chooses to sleep with
OL,4,Abedbugs
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I must have been bitten millions of
OL,7,Ftimes by now, so I stopped reacting a
OL,8,Flong time ago. I get a a red patch on
OL,9,Fmy arm after the bugs have fed, but it
OL,10,Fdisappears after about half an hour,"
OL,11,Fhe said.
